{"id":"56f6604e5f04b50c","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-goodstein-stopping-time.md","title":"Goodstein 的最小终止阶段","display":"df-goodstein-stopping-time — Goodstein 的最小终止阶段","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-goodstein-stopping-time","aliases":["72-df-goodstein-stopping-time"],"display":"df-goodstein-stopping-time — Goodstein 的最小终止阶段","depends_on":["[[72-thm-goodstein-termination]]"],"chapter":"III","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.III Theorem5.6, print192/PDF204; local stopping-time specialization","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"existence and uniqueness from the stopping set checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"created":"2026-10-22","revision_round":"2026-10-22-expansion"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-goodstein-stopping-time"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-goodstein-stopping-time</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-goodstein-stopping-time — Goodstein 的最小终止阶段"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ea940bfeb1e41d95\" href=\"?note=ea940bfeb1e41d95\" title=\"72-thm-goodstein-termination\">72-thm-goodstein-termination</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"III"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.III Theorem5.6, print192/PDF204; local stopping-time specialization"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"existence and uniqueness from the stopping set checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-22-expansion"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\ge2\">\\(b\\ge2\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\omega\">\\(a\\in\\omega\\)</span>，G 与终止性取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ea940bfeb1e41d95\" href=\"?note=ea940bfeb1e41d95\" title=\"72-thm-goodstein-termination\">72-thm-goodstein-termination</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell_G\">\\(\\ell_G\\)</span> 在下式定义，按从0起的步数计数，不是原书从 x 起的绝对阶段编号。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\ell_G(b,a):=\\min\\{k\\in\\omega:G_{b,a}(k)=0\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\ell_G(b,a):=\\min\\{k\\in\\omega:G_{b,a}(k)=0\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"G_{b,a}(\\ell_G(b,a))=0,\\qquad\\forall j&lt;\\ell_G(b,a)\\ (0&lt;G_{b,a}(j)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[G_{b,a}(\\ell_G(b,a))=0,\\qquad\\forall j&lt;\\ell_G(b,a)\\ (0&lt;G_{b,a}(j)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>终止定理使候选自然数集非空，良序性给最小值。a=0 时最小阶段为0。定义保留 b 作为结构参数，不能只用初始 a 决定终止长度。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-thm-goodstein-termination","status":"resolved","id":"ea940bfeb1e41d95","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-thm-goodstein-termination]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-thm-goodstein-termination","status":"resolved","id":"ea940bfeb1e41d95","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$b\\ge2$，$a\\in\\omega$，G 与终止性取 [[72-thm-goodstein-termination]]。$\\ell_G$ 在下式定义，按从0起的步数计数，不是原书从 x 起的绝对阶段编号。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"b\\ge2","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell_G(b,a):=\\min\\{k\\in\\omega:G_{b,a}(k)=0\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"G_{b,a}(\\ell_G(b,a))=0,\\qquad\\forall j<\\ell_G(b,a)\\ (0<G_{b,a}(j)).","display":true}],"bytes":1331,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-112","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"III章新增9项：[[72-df-goodstein-stopping-time]] · [[72-df-goodstein-subtract-then-bump]] · [[72-df-hereditary-base-change]] · [[72-df-hereditary-base-expression]] · [[72-df-hereditary-expression-evaluation]] · [[72-ex-goodstein-small-sequence]] · [[72-lem-goodstein-ordinal-descent]] · [[72-lem-hereditary-base-order]] · [[72-thm-goodstein-termination]]"},{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-486","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"III章新增9项：[[72-df-goodstein-stopping-time]] · [[72-df-goodstein-subtract-then-bump]] · [[72-df-hereditary-base-change]] · [[72-df-hereditary-base-expression]] · [[72-df-hereditary-expression-evaluation]] · [[72-ex-goodstein-small-sequence]] · [[72-lem-goodstein-ordinal-descent]] · [[72-lem-hereditary-base-order]] · [[72-thm-goodstein-termination]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-481","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"III章新增9项：[[72-df-goodstein-stopping-time]] · [[72-df-goodstein-subtract-then-bump]] · [[72-df-hereditary-base-change]] · [[72-df-hereditary-base-expression]] · [[72-df-hereditary-expression-evaluation]] · [[72-ex-goodstein-small-sequence]] · [[72-lem-goodstein-ordinal-descent]] · [[72-lem-hereditary-base-order]] · [[72-thm-goodstein-termination]]"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-109","locatio